        "slc_71fec820e0a3fe32c6198a23e594cc80873dc73b2969c5368d9615964b330164"
      ],
      "text": "InfCode is described as an adversarial multi-agent code agent system that uses LLMs to automatically analyze and fix repository issues, developed by Tokfinity's Code Research team and Beihang University."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_7952de424bdccaa9757528a2c39691c57e1fdf44db4aefb5cd1350c785ff456b",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "1dfd4c14a8359a414a6b5bd1aa75d18b8bbf2be7",
          "git_sha": "fcd1d2cf58df82607a0f445c675cb582581d5972",
          "line_end": 8,
          "line_start": 8,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "tokfinity/infcode",
          "url": "https://github.com/Tokfinity/InfCode/blob/1dfd4c14a8359a414a6b5bd1aa75d18b8bbf2be7/README.md#L8-L8"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_dddb022ecff8df0fd22278327003b4e609ebc21a7538e7a3c4679340d00e31b4"
      ],
      "text": "The system uses a dual-agent adversarial refinement framework that iteratively improves both test patches and code patches, aiming to produce fixes verified under strengthened test suites."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c3544f193d90f5b2941cdd929e21f436acdb86c45b50b5769f2813f8eb7efe4f",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "1dfd4c14a8359a414a6b5bd1aa75d18b8bbf2be7",
          "git_sha": "fcd1d2cf58df82607a0f445c675cb582581d5972",
          "line_end": 20,
          "line_start": 20,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "tokfinity/infcode",
          "url": "https://github.com/Tokfinity/InfCode/blob/1dfd4c14a8359a414a6b5bd1aa75d18b8bbf2be7/README.md#L20-L20"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2827fd89db7e8bf793c073cc18f52dee8edb7b5100de557975486197fee0fbbd"
      ],
      "text": "InfCode adopts a generate-select architecture: Patch Generation produces candidate patches and Patch Selection picks the optimal one."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_fd762139d56f0054f80cc703d8b9ef917667b0b5d9c823951b496d87dec5898a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "1dfd4c14a8359a414a6b5bd1aa75d18b8bbf2be7",
          "git_sha": "fcd1d2cf58df82607a0f445c675cb582581d5972",
          "line_end": 22,
          "line_start": 22,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "tokfinity/infcode",
          "url": "https://github.com/Tokfinity/InfCode/blob/1dfd4c14a8359a414a6b5bd1aa75d18b8bbf2be7/README.md#L22-L22"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_f8e0c7c2eefa0796380eda765a08f8bb5636c80b2130302d6731bc3cbb0a035a"
      ],
      "text": "The Patch Generator registers multiple generator groups, each in a separate container generating and repairing candidate patches in parallel, running up to 5 attempts and gathering all produced patches."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_7ca9a74339684ca7084e23faf0f2c19201ce74cac3f66e6acb7a1fcfa36cb04d",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "1dfd4c14a8359a414a6b5bd1aa75d18b8bbf2be7",
          "git_sha": "fcd1d2cf58df82607a0f445c675cb582581d5972",
          "line_end": 24,
          "line_start": 24,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "tokfinity/infcode",
          "url": "https://github.com/Tokfinity/InfCode/blob/1dfd4c14a8359a414a6b5bd1aa75d18b8bbf2be7/README.md#L24-L24"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_723c57118c16b71691adb483a3a267631b64c79d423e8322469725ba48575ec7"
      ],
      "text": "Inside the Generator, a Test Patch Generator strengthens tests to expose faults while a Code Patch Generator refines patches to satisfy the enhanced tests, in an adversarial loop."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_2c01104390a38d7a52a30d586ad8825f364021fad2769f4141ed439c20c96294",
