        "slc_ded871867bc415bda4c64a7e38cf57e5555039df93d31351057b2627d9b777a0"
      ],
      "text": "Auxiliary modules include an Image Builder (per-example container images stored locally and reused), a Tool Executor (runs commands in containers and returns outputs), and an LLM API Manager."
    },
